<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>电竞 on 编程那些事儿</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E7%94%B5%E7%AB%9E/</link><description>Recent content in 电竞 on 编程那些事儿</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:31:03 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E7%94%B5%E7%AB%9E/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>电竞与直播</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/sports/esports-and-streaming/</link><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/sports/esports-and-streaming/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;美式游戏语音里的英语有两个特点：&lt;strong&gt;语速快、句子极短&lt;/strong&gt;，而且大量是固定说法（call-outs）。队友喊一句 &lt;code&gt;On me&lt;/code&gt; 或者 &lt;code&gt;Rotate&lt;/code&gt;，你得在半秒内反应——这跟球场上喊话是一样的道理。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>